{"id":"28bf663e6fb6ecbf","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/559_邻域模态逻辑.md","title":"559 邻域模态逻辑","display":"559_邻域模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始句法构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换\">3. 自由变元、绑定与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。无绑定构造子，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{559}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,559}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{559}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,559}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{559}=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{559}=\\operatorname{PV}_{559}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{559})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{559}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{559}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{559}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{559}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{559}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{559}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{559}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{559}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{559}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{559}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础邻域模态逻辑不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 当作正规必然性算子；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 公理与必然化规则不属于本条目。总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{559}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{559}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{559}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{559}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>MP 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>邻域等价替换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box B}\\ (RE).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\Box A\\leftrightarrow\\Box B}\\ (RE).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{559}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{559}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}\\)</span>，并且每行满足以下四种条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{559}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{559}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{559}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{559}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性与后承\">7. 可证性与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{559}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{559}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{559}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{559}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{559}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{559}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{559}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{559}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{559}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-规则证书\">8. 规则证书</h1>\n<p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"559\">\\(559\\)</span>-推导证书是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\pi,r,A,i)\">\\((\\Gamma,\\pi,r,A,i)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{559}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的行号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 行公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是四类行理由之一。证书合法当且仅当第 6 节中对应的集合条件成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-邻域语义载体与后承\">9. 邻域语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>邻域模型集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\n=\n\\{(W,N,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ N:W\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(W)),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\n=\n\\{(W,N,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ N:W\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(W)),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{559}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,N,V)\\in\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\">\\(M=(W,N,V)\\in\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，同时定义满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{559}A\\)</span> 与真集函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A⟧_M^{559}=\\{u\\in W:M,u\\models_{559}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A⟧_M^{559}=\\{u\\in W:M,u\\models_{559}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in V(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{559}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in V(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\not\\models_{559}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\not\\models_{559}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{559}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{559}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{559}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{559}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{559}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{559}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{559}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{559}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_M^{559}\\in N(w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{559}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ A⟧_M^{559}\\in N(w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{559}^{\\mathsf N}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{559}^{\\mathsf N}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,N,V)\\in\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\">\\(M=(W,N,V)\\in\\mathsf{NMod}_{559}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{559}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{559}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{559}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{559}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 作为邻域模态算子处理，核心规则是等价替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559}\\)</span>。它不同于正规 Kripke 模态逻辑，因为本系统没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}\\)</span>，也没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 的必然化规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{559}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{559},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{559},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{559},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,559},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{559},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{559},\n\\operatorname{last}_{559},\n\\vdash_{559},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{559},\n\\mathsf{NMod}_{559},\n\\models_{559},\n\\models_{559}^{\\mathsf N}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N_{559}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{559},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{559},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{559},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{559},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,559},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{559},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{RE}^{559},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{559},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{559},\n\\operatorname{last}_{559},\n\\vdash_{559},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{559},\n\\mathsf{NMod}_{559},\n\\models_{559},\n\\models_{559}^{\\mathsf N}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含邻域模态逻辑的句法、公理、等价替换规则、证明对象、可证性、邻域模型和语义后承；不含单调性假设、可靠性证明或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","l